Improved REST API performance for responses containing Location or Platform representations by memoizing two per-object config reads — `LOCATION_NAME_AS_NATURAL_KEY` in `Location.display` and `NETWORK_DRIVERS` in the network-driver mapping helpers — each previously a cache-backend round-trip per rendered object (e.g. once per device in a `?depth=1` device list). Added a `get_settings_or_config_memoized` helper for per-object config reads whose values already carry signal-driven cache invalidation.
